      "label": "Pink Holster (Mindscape Cinema N°4)",
      "description": "Initial duration of Zeroed In increases to 16s, and Orphie & Magus's EX Special Attack: Heat Charge and Ultimate: Dance With Fire DMG increases by 40%.",
      "shortDescription": "Orphie & Magus' DMG from EX Special Attack: Heat Charge and Ultimate: Dance With Fire is increased by 40%.",
